	quest.257DBBF27BA8ED08.quest_desc: [
		"This acts like the storage terminal but it has one additional functionality, the ability to craft! It will retain the items in the crafting grid when closed."
		""
		"If you are in a team it is recommended you make one terminal for each player and place them on the inventory connector or an inventory cable connector, as when you get into the wireless terminals you'll need to link them to a terminal and it can be frustrating when multiple people are trying to craft at the same time."
