	quest.3A41BC8707C797D1.quest_subtitle: "Uses rotational force to pump liquids through Fluid Pipes."
	quest.3A79649B13DE8F8D.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.3A79649B13DE8F8D.quest_subtitle: "Can be caught anywhere in the &4Nether&r. It will require a rod that can withstand lava."
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.quest_desc: [
		"Got your eye on a new recruit and need some hay bales? If you place a postbox outside your tavern you can request items from the warehouse and a courier will deliver them to the postbox."
		""
		"Similarly, if you have items you want taken to the warehouse, place them in a Stash and a courier will be along shortly to pick them up."
	]
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.title: "Postbox and Stash"
	quest.3B43DB1A6B0A7B44.quest_desc: ["{atm9.quest.mekanism.desc.bioFuel}"]
	quest.3B43DB1A6B0A7B44.title: "{atm9.quest.mekanism.bioFuel}"
	quest.3B45167934C7E6DB.quest_desc: [
		"&bBuilding Wands&r are incredibly useful tools that can help you tackle large projects in a fraction of the time!"
		""
		"To start off, you'll want to get a wand. There are four obtainable types, with each tier increasing the number of blocks you can manipulate:"
		""
		"Stone: 16 blocks"
		"Iron: 32 blocks"
		"Diamond: 64 blocks"
		"Netherite: 256 blocks"
		""
		"Once you have your wand, press '&bG&r' to open the &bWand Menu&r. This is where you can adjust the wand to fit whatever you need!"
		""
		"&9Tip&r: If you're playing in Survival and want to use a wand to remove a lot of blocks, make sure to bind a proper tool in the &bWand Menu&r! Don't forget to keep track of your tool's durability!"
		""
		"During your builds, you might want a way to store a bunch of blocks. This is where &bMagic Bags&r come in! With three tiers, each offering multiple levels of storage, you'll be able to stack a block way past 64!"
		""
		"Finally, if you wish to randomize the blocks you use, you can utilize the &bPalette&r! Simply select the blocks you want, and instead of filling with one block, it will randomly place them."
	]
	quest.3B45167934C7E6DB.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.3B732B903EA0C287.quest_subtitle: "No unique ability."
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.quest_desc: ["{atm9.quest.rs.desc.security}"]
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.quest_subtitle: "{atm9.quest.rs.subt.security}"
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.title: "{atm9.quest.rs.security}"
	quest.3B8653292F7A7FB8.quest_subtitle: "Similar to a campfire, but it holds 6 items."
	quest.3B908E6E3FB427F1.title: "&2Animal Breeding IV"
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_desc: [
		"Possibly one of the most dangerous jobs, especially early on. The Nether Miner travels to the Nether to mine resources. When the miner travels through the portal, there is a chance they may die. So choose your worker carefully."
		""
		"The portal in the Nether Mine will transport players to the Nether. However, the Nether Miner does not actually travel into the Nether, nor do they actually mine any blocks in the Nether."
	]
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Nether Mine"
