	quest.3F0DFC24A3ED6D51.quest_desc: [
		"Trinkets and Accessories can be obtained from beating bosses within the &bAether&r dimension."
		""
		"&o&7To equip them&r;"
		""
		"Simply press \"&ee&r\" to open up your inventory, look at the left of your charaters feet and click on the cloud icon to access a new inventory screen to equip them."
		""
		"Any armour set bonuses require the glove type also."
