		"Additionally, it can fish in lava."
	]
	quest.50EBFE4F41A442AD.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.50F29E3E3E58D774.quest_subtitle: "No subtitle for this one, I am trying to hit GM 1 on Marvel Rivals."
