	quest.51F5A049ABCE2D87.quest_desc: [
		"This block can be best described as an import and export bus combined into one."
		""
		"Imagine this block as a hopper: the small point will insert items into inventories it's facing, while an inventory on top of it will have items extracted. You can set filters to specify what is pulled out of an inventory or to designate what items go into specific inventories."
