		"- Magma Cream"
		"- Basalt Bass"
		"- Bonefish"
		"- Obsidian Halibut"
		"- Crimson Fungus"
		"- Magma Cod"
		"- Blaze Rods"
		"- Blaze Rod (fishing)"
		"- Skeletal Rod"
		"- Block of Gold"
		"- Netherite Ingot or Scrap (Extremely Rare)"
	]
