	quest.699182EA223BDA47.quest_desc: [
		"Twice powerfull as the vanilla &aPiston-Slime Block setup&r."
		"It can also push you up if you were to fall on it from a certain height when it's already extended."
		"Cannot push blocks like a normal &aPiston&r, only &eentities&r."
		"Allows &eentities&r that stand on an extended one to jump slightly higher."
	]
	quest.699182EA223BDA47.quest_subtitle: "It extends like a piston and will propel any entities that lie ontop of it in the direction it's moving."
