	quest.705C84A4E994C643.title: "Start a museum !"
	quest.7085E7D574481206.title: "&2Crop Collection"
	quest.70A627EADC8BFAC6.quest_desc: [
		"After you've taken the photos you want with the color film, begin developing it by combining it with a &bMundane Potion&r, &bAwkward Potion&r, and &bThick Potion&r to get the developed film roll."
		""
		"Once you have the developed roll, move on to the light room!"
	]
	quest.70A627EADC8BFAC6.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.717A0F8A80A048AC.quest_desc: [
		"The Wireless Terminal is essentially the baby brother of the Advanced Wireless Terminal."
		""
		"Despite its name implying \"wireless\" functionality, it's not truly wireless. This tier of the wireless terminal simply enables you to access the storage terminal or crafting terminal from approximately 17 blocks away. However, it requires line of sight to the terminals, and you must right-click while holding it to open the grid."
		""
		"It's highly recommended to upgrade to the advanced tier as soon as possible for enhanced functionality."
	]
	quest.717A0F8A80A048AC.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.718A2040D868E09F.quest_desc: ["{atm9.quest.rs.desc.1048mstorage}"]
	quest.718A2040D868E09F.title: "{atm9.quest.rs.1048mstorage}"
	quest.71C8792B19119B91.quest_subtitle: "Backpacks crafted with minerals!"
	quest.71FCF06A98CC66D7.quest_desc: [
		"With so many colonists working for the greater good it can be difficult to know who needs what. The clipboard is an easy way to see all the requests your workers have."
		""
		"&eSneak + right-click&r on your town hall block to register the clipboard."
	]
	quest.72C008AA321DD359.quest_desc: [
		"Just like scaffolding they can only go that far out horizontally from their closest support until they are no longer supported."
		"Vertical ropes have no hitbox and can be climbed."
		"Horizontal ropes do have a hitbox and can be walked on, albeit at a slower paste."
		""
		"Placing a rope against an existing vertical one will result in the rope getting extended downwards."
		"Ropes can be placed and will dynamically wrap themselves against many fence like blocks such as walls, beams and posts."
		""
		"Falling down ropes will not slow you down but still prevent fall damange."
		"Can be broken by a projectile."
	]
	quest.72C008AA321DD359.quest_subtitle: "A building block that makes movement easier, especially in mines."
	quest.72C008AA321DD359.title: "Rope"
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_desc: [
		"Citizens will go to the Residence they are assigned to at night to sleep. The Residence is also a way to get more citizens for your colony. Every residence level adds another bed. More beds means more citizen capacity."
		""
		"It’s worth considering residence locations and the citizens they house. Workers get grumpy when they have to travel long distances to work. Try to move citizens into homes close to where they work. "
	]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_subtitle: "Build a Residence"
	quest.72C9825C4040E66C.quest_desc: ["The Inventory Cable Connector works similarly to the Inventory Connector block, but it will only read the inventory it is directly connected to and no other inventory. This can be useful for reading the output of single storage blocks like Drawers or Barrels that aren't near your bulk storage area. Additionally, it can be used as a platform to place a terminal on."]
	quest.72C9825C4040E66C.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.730E9C4314C75452.quest_desc: [
		"&bWooden Crates&r are fished up in the &2Overworld&r in any biome and contain the following:"
		""
		"&2Common Drops&r:"
		"- Seaweed"
		"- Kelp"
		"- Cobwebs"
		"- String"
		"- Wheat"
		"- Carrots"
		"- Beetroots"
		"- Salmon"
		"- Cod"
		"- Sticks"
		"- Iron and Gold Nuggets"
		"- Flint"
		"- Coal"
		""
		"&6Rare Drops&r:"
		"- Iron and Gold Ingots"
		"- Iron Ore"
		"- Bottles o' Enchanting"
		"- Emeralds"
		"- Buckets"
		"- Buckets of Fish"
		"- Pufferfish"
		"- Bows"
		"- Crossbows"
		"- Enchanted Books"
	]
	quest.730E9C4314C75452.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.732E63D8FE0AF497.quest_subtitle: "Slow and fuel-hungry, but carries an entire storage."
	quest.733D249EF34F497B.quest_desc: [
		"The hose is a tool that has three functionalities:"
		""
		"&bSuck Mode:&r"
		"Allows you to pick up fluid from the world or, if clicked on a tank, transfer it into the backpack's internal tank buffer."
		""
		"&bSpill Mode:&r"
		"Allows you to spill the fluid into the world or, if clicked on a tank, store it within the tank (similar to a bucket)."
		""
		"&bDrink Mode:&r"
		"Allows the player to drink the contents of the backpack's tanks. Not all fluids are drinkable; some may give special effects. "
		""
		"To swap between these modes, hold '&bZ&r' and scroll up or down to change the mode."
		""
		"Pressing '&bN&r' while holding a hose and wearing a backpack will swap it to the secondary tank within the backpack!"
	]
	quest.733D249EF34F497B.quest_subtitle: "Information on the Hose"
	quest.73614F77165F238C.quest_subtitle: "Obtained by killing hoglins with a knife,"
	quest.73C4BF145A20C5E7.quest_desc: ["A &bFroglight&r drops from a &4Magma Cube&r when it's killed by a &bFrog&r. The type of &bFroglight&r that drops depends on the type of &bFrog&r."]
	quest.73C4BF145A20C5E7.quest_subtitle: "Wait, you have to do WHAT?"
	quest.73DFBBBFEBDA073D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sprinklers&r can be crafted with:"
		""
		"4x &bCopper Sheet&r"
		"1x &bFluid Pipe&r"
		"1x &bIron Bar&r"
		""
		"&aPondering is recommended.&r"
	]
	quest.73DFBBBFEBDA073D.quest_subtitle: "Give that farmland some water!"
